Dataset
  Roboflow Universe -- "construction-safety-gsnvb" (roboflow-100 family)
  License: CC BY 4.0
  Obtained via the Hugging Face mirror:
    hf-mirror.com/datasets/LibreYOLO/construction-safety-gsnvb
  1206 images (997 train / 119 valid / 90 test) with YOLO-format labels.
  If you redistribute the images you must keep the CC BY 4.0 attribution.

Model weights
  Hugging Face -- "mancalazure/construction-ppe-safety"  (best.onnx)
  License: CC BY 4.0
  YOLOv8n fine-tuned on Roboflow "construction-site-safety v28",
  exported to ONNX (opset 12), 12,245,828 bytes.
  SHA256 1D5F3CF69883E89BA6E2B3836A0B21623044E9A682F1F00DFBACAC97B99BAF94

Screenshots / rendered overlays under web/assets*, demo*/ and the photos in
test/, valid/, train/ are derived from the dataset above and therefore remain
CC BY 4.0. All photographs contain real human faces; they are used for a
classroom demo only and must not be redistributed as a face dataset.
